adding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">세부사항 첨부 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014-2</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 수강신청 안내문 참조</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3.</span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">유의사항</span></strong></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">재수강 취득성적은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">A</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이하만 가능</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">재수강을 원하면 해당과목 혹은 동일대체된 과목을 수강신청하면 됨</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청시 재수강여부에 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">Y</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">는 재수강과목임</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">변경은 정해진 기간 이외에는 할 수 없음</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청 공지사항 첨부물을 숙지한 후 신청</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강지도상담 결과 조회</span></strong></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ </span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강지도상담 승인</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">미승인 내역은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원스톱</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">상담</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강지도상담조회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에서 조회함</span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">본인의 수강신청 소홀 및 대리수강신청 등에 따른 착오로 인하여 졸업을 하지 못하는 학생이 매학기 발생하고 있으니</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청을 소홀히 하여 불이익을 당하지 않도록 유의하여야 합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">특히 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2006</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도부터 공학교육인증과정이 도입되었으니</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이수원칙을 확실히 숙지한</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">[2014-2</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 교육과정 이수원칙 및 첨부물</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">후 수강신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0p